---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<section id="contact" class="section">

  <span class="sec-label">Contact</span>

  <div class="contact-body">
    <p class="contact-intro">
      Open to SRE, DevOps, and cloud infrastructure roles.<br />
      Also interested in internships, hackathons, and problems worth solving.
    </p>

    <table class="contact-table mono">
      <tbody>
        <tr><td class="ck">email</td><td><a href="mailto:vasileandreipopan@gmail.com">vasileandreipopan@gmail.com</a></td></tr>
        <tr><td class="ck">github</td><td><a href="https://github.com/vasileandreipopan" target="_blank" rel="noopener">vasileandreipopan</a></td></tr>
        <tr><td class="ck">linkedin</td><td><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/vasile-andrei-popan" target="_blank" rel="noopener">vasile-andrei-popan</a></td></tr>
        <tr><td class="ck">phone</td><td><a href="tel:+34688759267">+34 688 759 267</a></td></tr>
        <tr><td class="ck">location</td><td>Bilbao, Spain</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="spacer"></div>

  <p class="footer mono">&copy; {year} Vasile Andrei Popan &mdash; Built with Astro<span class="blink">_</span></p>

</section>

<style>
  .contact-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  .contact-intro {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .contact-table {
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .contact-table tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--light); }
  .contact-table tr:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--light); }

  .ck {
    color: var(--dark);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 0.55rem 2rem 0.55rem 0;
    vertical-align: top;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .contact-table td:last-child { padding: 0.55rem 0; }

  .footer {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--dark);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>